| --- | --- | --- |
| Attempt ID | Controller random | Kernel random, 128 bit, nonzero (initiator); the INIT's ID for a responder |
| Receive locator | Controller random | Kernel random, nonzero, checked against every retained and pending locator of the gateway |
| `STAGE_GENERATION` | Any ID and locator | Only for the pending attempt, with the locator it was issued; once per attempt |
